        "version": "1.0.0.0",
        "description": "Premium dual-hierarchy KPI decomposition tree. Drill horizontally and vertically with DAX-driven font colors and per-KPI icons. Smart recenter on expand and persistent viewport state across sessions. Unwatermarked and Microsoft Certified for enterprise deployment.",
